    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Refactor consent handling in job alerts]]></title>
        <id>https://gitlab.sieuviet.services/recommendation/service-recommendation/-/commit/4b65ee0e9c993a33d6d3d9aa19a9f2e0f2a548dc</id>
        <link href="https://gitlab.sieuviet.services/recommendation/service-recommendation/-/commit/4b65ee0e9c993a33d6d3d9aa19a9f2e0f2a548dc"/>
        <updated>2026-07-06T03:28:21.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[- Updated `fetchConsentRefusedSeekerIds` to accept a list of seeker IDs for better flexibility.
- Introduced `notificationResultSeekerIds` method to retrieve seeker IDs with current notifications.
- Enhanced job alert logic to skip seekers who have refused consent, improving compliance with consent policies.
- Improved logging for consent-related operations to aid in debugging and tracking.]]></summary>
        <author>
            <name>Service Recommendation:production commits</name>
        </author>
    </entry>
